These are extra (not required for BBS operation)
rexxDoors current as of BBBBS version 8.4

These ARexx programs were originally written by various people,
please see the individual files for more author information.

They are gathered here, altered to work with BBBBS, as a convenience
to BBBBS sysops. Some are shareware, PLEASE support shareware authors.

Included:
